    "detailed_description": "Gracia is a platform that redefines virtual reality, offering free-viewpoint ultra-photorealistic VR experiences. It's not just about seeing; it's about stepping inside a volumetric photo with freedom to walk around, where every detail is so vivid, you'll forget it's virtual.<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br>- Unmatched Photorealism: Gracia\u2019s advanced rendering technology blurs the line between virtual and reality and creates a feeling as if you are inside high-resolution photograph. <br>- 6DOF Volumetric Scenes: Move and interact within our scenes with complete freedom as if you were really there.<br>- Extremely High Fidelity: Up to 550 fps at native resolution.<br>- User-Generated Content: Publish your own PLY scenes on Gracia, enhancing the platform's collection <br>- Ever Expanding Collection of Scenes: Regular updates keep the content fresh and exciting.",
    "about_the_game": "Gracia is a platform that redefines virtual reality, offering free-viewpoint ultra-photorealistic VR experiences. It's not just about seeing; it's about stepping inside a volumetric photo with freedom to walk around, where every detail is so vivid, you'll forget it's virtual.<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br>- Unmatched Photorealism: Gracia\u2019s advanced rendering technology blurs the line between virtual and reality and creates a feeling as if you are inside high-resolution photograph. <br>- 6DOF Volumetric Scenes: Move and interact within our scenes with complete freedom as if you were really there.<br>- Extremely High Fidelity: Up to 550 fps at native resolution.<br>- User-Generated Content: Publish your own PLY scenes on Gracia, enhancing the platform's collection <br>- Ever Expanding Collection of Scenes: Regular updates keep the content fresh and exciting.",
    "short_description": "Gracia is the world's first platform for viewing and publishing free-viewpoint ultra-photorealistic VR experiences. It's not just about seeing; it's about stepping inside a photo with freedom to walk around, where every detail is so vivid, you'll forget it's virtual.",
